# ProGen3D Kinetic Assembly — native grammar
# Four supported, parameterised spur-wheel visualisations with real teeth,
# separate spokes, chamfered rings, hubs, shafts, bearing collars and fasteners.
# Prescribed motion only: no tooth-contact or stress solver is implied.
# Editable parameters: uniform scale, drive teeth, follower teeth, module, drive degrees/s.
# Default 32:24 gearing at 90:-120 degrees/s has a 12 second closed loop.
# @texture silverbrushedmetal brushed_metal uv 2 18
# @texture lavenderwhiteplastic none
# @texture mintwhiteplastic none
# @texture ivorymattepaint none
# @texture smokyglass none


